---
import PageTitle from "~/components/PageTitle.astro";
import BaseLayout from "~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <PageTitle 
    title="About" 
    crumbs={["Home:/", "About:/about"]}
  />

  <section class="tw:flex tw:flex-col tw:gap-y-4">
    <hgroup>
      <h2 class="tw:text-2xl">Aliases</h2>
      <p class="tw:text-base">Names I also go by on the Internet</p>
    </hgroup>
    <ul class="tw:list-disc tw:list-outside tw:pl-4 tw:flex tw:flex-col tw:gap-y-2">
      <li><span class="tw:font-bold">simple(authority)</span>: Discord and some other online communities, namely Minecraft related. Don't ask the origin, it is truly just a random name. It's also the name of a security software I believe, which is unrelated to my usage.</li>
      <li><span class="tw:font-bold">Arkita</span>: (Old School) RuneScape and some other RPG games.</li>
      <li><span class="tw:font-bold">OraBrush</span>: I don't use it anymore. I just really liked <a href="https://orabrush.com/">OraBrushes</a>.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>